      "voice_id": "LifjXiNLcYfyYJD8PCDT",
      "voice_name": "LaRauque - Hoarse, Deep, and Dramatic",
      "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
      "text": "Crates, mostly. The coaster unloads onto the quay and somebody has to carry them across to the sheds. It pays by the crate, on the spot.",
